---
// Services.astro
---

<section class="services" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="services-top">
      <h2 class="services-headline reveal">
        THREE<br/>
        SERVICES.<br/>
        <span class="red">ONE FOCUS.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="services-intro reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <p>
          We don't try to do everything. We do three things at a level most agencies can't touch —
          <strong>and they all point at the same goal: more customers finding you first.</strong>
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px">
          Every service is built around what actually moves the needle for brick-and-mortar businesses in Texas. Not vanity metrics. Not pretty reports. Customers walking through your door.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card reveal">
        <div class="service-number">01</div>
        <div class="service-tag">Local SEO</div>
        <h3 class="service-name">Google Maps<br/>Domination</h3>
        <p class="service-desc">
          Most businesses are invisible on Google and have no idea why. We do. We've reverse-engineered exactly what it takes to own the local map pack — and we build it for you from scratch. GBP rebuild, citations, reviews, signals. The full picture.
        </p>
        <ul class="service-includes">
          <li>Complete GBP rebuild &amp; optimization</li>
          <li>Citation cleanup &amp; authority building</li>
          <li>Review generation system</li>
          <li>Local keyword &amp; competitor targeting</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="service-number">02</div>
        <div class="service-tag">Web Design</div>
        <h3 class="service-name">Sites That<br/>Actually Convert</h3>
        <p class="service-desc">
          A pretty website that nobody finds is an expensive hobby. We build fast, SEO-ready sites engineered around one goal: turning the people who find you into customers. No templates. No bloat. No page builders.
        </p>
        <ul class="service-includes">
          <li>Custom design, mobile-first</li>
          <li>Core Web Vitals &amp; speed optimization</li>
          <li>Schema markup &amp; technical SEO</li>
          <li>Conversion-focused copywriting</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="service-number">03</div>
        <div class="service-tag">Social Media</div>
        <h3 class="service-name">Content That<br/>Builds Authority</h3>
        <p class="service-desc">
          Posting random stuff and hoping isn't a strategy — it's noise. We create content that makes you the obvious choice in your market. Branded, consistent, and built to keep your business top-of-mind when customers are ready to buy.
        </p>
        <ul class="service-includes">
          <li>Content strategy &amp; calendar</li>
          <li>Branded graphics &amp; video</li>
          <li>Caption copy with local SEO intent</li>
          <li>Scheduling &amp; performance tracking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
